  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're everything I thought you never were",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And nothing like I thought you could've been",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But still, you live inside of me",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "So tell me, how is that?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You're the only one I wish I could forget",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "The only one I'd love to not forgive",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And though you break my heart",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You're the only one",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And though there are times when I hate you 'cause I can't erase",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "The times that you hurt me and put tears on my face",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And even now while I hate you, it pains me to say",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I know I'll be there at the end of the day",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I don't wanna be without you, babe",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I don't want a broken heart",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Don't wanna take a breath without you, babe",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I don't wanna play that part",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I know that I love you, but let me just say",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I don't wanna love you in no kind of way, no, no",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I don't want a broken heart",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And I don't wanna play the broken-hearted girl, no, no",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "No broken-hearted girl",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I'm no broken-hearted girl",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Something that I feel I need to say",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But up to now, I've always been afraid",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "That you would never come around",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And still I wanna put this out",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You say you've got the most respect for me",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But sometimes I feel you're not deserving me",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And still you're in my heart",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "But you're the only one",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And yes, there are times when I hate you, but I don't complain",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "'Cause I've been afraid that you would walk away",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Oh, but now I don't hate you, I'm happy to say",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "That I will be there at the end of the day",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
